{"id":"vod_sn_37696","vodId":"37696","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"瓦尼塔斯的笔记第二季","name_cn":"瓦尼塔斯的笔记第二季","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6d90da72df0f761af5eec2d31414ac40.jpg"},"summary":"TV动画《瓦尼塔斯的手记》第二季度第1弹PV及视觉图公开，将于2022 年1月14日开始播出。望月淳原作によるTVアニメ「ヴァニタスの手記（カルテ）」が、分割2クールで放送されることが決定。19世纪巴黎×吸血鬼×蒸汽朋克——您不曾听说过吗？关于将诅咒散播于吸血鬼的那本、机械驱动的魔导书的故事。现在被“瓦尼塔斯之书”所引导、演员们集结于巴黎。蓝色的皮革封面下是漆黑的纸张，用银之锁捆绑住的机械传动的魔法书，那就是瓦尼塔斯之书！从吸血鬼瓦尼塔斯手上继承了瓦尼塔斯之书和他的名号的普通人类瓦尼塔斯，与在“吸血鬼的不祥之月”蓝色月光的庇护下出生的吸血鬼诺相遇、同行、最终相杀的故事。「Pandora Hearts」的望月淳所带来的吸血鬼谭——开幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:41","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/udJTAYLSys1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MF3L9zntzi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2vVyKKdUCN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/r7sxcCNPQc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8EFfBzS62u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ekrm1Mdsdb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hWsCR7tY4m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/c1n88FzZKK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SWN6dMNTCN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QaRnYg1kSv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wyhd4CMB7D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AzBTcyZmCh1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:07.918Z"}